{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1068f0de06ded195f30ee2c8d7c726d54738c71cc7d6eeaa3a394dd5920b24c", "ja": "（千早のサイン会のため、秋葉原の本屋にやってきた。\nもうすぐ開店だが、千早は……）", "zh": "（今天因为有千早的签名会，所以来到秋叶原的书店。\n不过就快开店了，千早却……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "9f5603d2829e400980b11f3151c4d8a0c2e3aa841932b16c56c4b9173c67b429", "ja": "……たくさんあるのね……。", "zh": "……有很多呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1002_p", "source_sha256": "245c0d6425d40416ec409a3cfadcba1e400d807ef0f7bafef62303b663ea4abd", "ja": "おーい、千早。なんだ、売り場にいたのか。\nもうすぐ開店だけど、なにをしてたんだ？", "zh": "喂～千早。什么嘛，原来你在卖场里啊。\n就快开店啰，你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "7e7c85db28031dbb2c3270868326a726577add1312e4b6ce88eb6de5caa15b27", "ja": "はい、店内の雰囲気をつかんでおこうと、\n見てまわっていました。", "zh": "啊，我想先了解店里的气氛，\n就稍微逛了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "a3cc342d401549edb3e75f2eef584662794ec4deaed6d7830825dcc63c0ee0d9", "ja": "それにしても、すごい数の書籍ですね。\n作品を探すのも大変そうです。", "zh": "话说回来，这里的书籍数量真是惊人。\n光是找作品似乎也得花上一番工夫呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1005_p", "source_sha256": "15dfc00943bc83fd7c9843b3e1301829ba06a3b9c2ab7e9db291f18ed01b325b", "ja": "ん？　もしかして、\nお目当ての本があるのか？", "zh": "嗯？难不成，\n你有想找的书吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "efa15f6f34ab1ca0aa726b27c99872d58e5d3f3313d3506caa52936966e958f1", "ja": "いえ、特にそうわけでは。ただ、マンガや\nライトノベルで、何かいいものがないかと思って。", "zh": "不，其实我没有特别要找什么，\n只是想看看有没有不错的漫画或轻小说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1007_p", "source_sha256": "baa56a731ac566c0d08d8a91bc940f8b5430c1323f6631daff699351a5d26e84", "ja": "へえ、意外だな。\n千早もそういうの読むのか。", "zh": "哦，真意外耶。\n原来千早也会看这种类型的书。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "10fc75d4c8c12fac9e785935bb6212f82101fc02304f7f07ffa29cc5469577cf", "ja": "こちらの書店では、そういった本が人気だと\n聞いたので……最近、読み始めました。", "zh": "因为我听说那种书在这里的书店很受欢迎……\n最近就开始看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "359f9ecc2ccda48df4d4bfc6c30133693c42fb715f130749d58870c6bc1f3597", "ja": "それに、以前からファンレターやサイン会で、\nファンの方がそういう話題を出すことも多くて。", "zh": "而且，过去在粉丝信或签名会上，\n粉丝们也常常提到这类话题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "ef347b52fcd64a10bd486bb43500278ba049ab569b1b060aa065e65d9b8007f5", "ja": "……知りたくなったんです。\n皆さんが興味を持っているものを。", "zh": "……所以我想多了解一下\n大家感兴趣的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1011_p", "source_sha256": "85664da3583bff0bb643c8298c5f0aa79a37059726a8a1c71cf74a12ccd2dd5e", "ja": "なるほどな。\n……だったら、このマンガとかはどうだ？", "zh": "原来如此……\n那么，这部漫画怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "4bdc6abcd7636208db121439989b0cdf3450108d321f6a576fc8631e8d8c3f4d", "ja": "これは……、あっ！\n先日、七尾さんが薦めてくれたものですね。", "zh": "这部漫画是……啊！\n前几天七尾有跟我推荐过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "4b4fddafa42b67ba8e87f1cf925925c64a520ce2d28aa4a4e382694f1be6c454", "ja": "歌を力に変えて戦う少女達の物語だとかで……。\n読んでみたいと思っていたところです。", "zh": "听说这是一部描述少女们将歌声化为力量奋战的故事……\n所以我本来就想看看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7c79a240f7e3663699790ac61fd204874afc48d50e26a8c465ccc55ecbc63df3", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか……。\nよかった、探す手間が省けたな！", "zh": "哦，是这样啊……\n那就太好了，不用再花时间找了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "fe41005bd514a5c3cca0148771287f8c43f73ac169fdea90713dcfe137488858", "ja": "……でも、さすがですね。\n私が興味を持つ本を、ピタリと当てるなんて。", "zh": "……不过你果然很有一套，\n居然一下就挑中我有兴趣的书。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f73a6257f7a066e43ddc76273ebd19f52a12ce236e2148afd4df4ba64b986b1f", "ja": "いや、千早と同じだよ。千早がファンのことを\n知りたいと思って、マンガに興味を持ったように……。", "zh": "没什么，其实我跟千早差不多。\n就像千早为了更了解粉丝，而对漫画产生兴趣一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e2666ec66ae2b55d80d04a759d20a6d87d21288a74098bd0cf2169e473bb344c", "ja": "俺も千早のことを知りたいって、\nよく思ってるだけというか。", "zh": "我也只是常常想着\n「希望能更了解千早」而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "d164b5f34998d223532c06e0e70d0fe5514c261aa378f8092c4cce7b893d4a4d", "ja": "……あの、では、{$P$}の\n好きな本も、教えてもらえますか？", "zh": "……那、那么，可以请问\n{$P$}喜欢什么样的书吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f752dd42b0cf577c70564b58b4106f4f2853cdf9eb1f8481a764398f0df9a3bb", "ja": "ん？　別にいいけど、千早の好みには\n合わないかもしれないぞ？", "zh": "嗯？可以是可以，\n但可能不符合千早的喜好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "e3200dddbb9f71d7814a14b085b8fadd1796e44975ee1180ae6dcc8697dece73", "ja": "かまいません……その、読んでみたいんです。", "zh": "没关系……我就想读读看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4f6be42a3990b84eeb5a80a2a3e6c64dec54fb0230af455ede4df3caf2db4a77", "ja": "そうか？　それなら、これと……これと……。\nあっ、千早なら、あれも気に入るかもしれないな！", "zh": "这样啊？那就，这本跟……这本……\n啊，千早搞不好也会喜欢那本！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "c6155e664d6544d63b4eac069426a6ed6a2eb808e3adb385615438473a5df29c", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。\n……あの、一冊ずつ、読んでみますね。", "zh": "谢、谢谢你……\n那个，我会试着一本本看下去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0144_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "f9ff69fb9dc29bc7648f50c7e2eee4edd4b3eabf9449641809923222a80e8ed2", "ja": "ページをめくるたびに、少しずつ……。\n学んでいきます。……ふふっ。", "zh": "每翻过一页……\n就能够多了解一点……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
